+/**************************************************************************//**
+ @Function      t_FmMacExceptionCallback
+
+ @Description   Fm Mac Exception Callback from FM MAC to the user
+
+ @Param[in]     h_App             - Handle to the upper layer handler
+
+ @Param[in]     exceptions        - The exception that occurred
